OL,3,GNEWSA'Shocking' amount spent on road
OL,4,Aupgrade scheme with no start date
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoyle assembly member Mark H Durkan
OL,7,Fsaid the #9m figure was shocking and
OL,8,Fthe lack of progress on big government
OL,9,Fprojects had become a "depressingly
OL,10,Ffamiliar scenario".
